  "distanthorizons.config.client.qualityPresetSetting": "质量预设",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.qualityPresetSetting.@tooltip": "修改一些图形设置以快速更改渲染质量。\n\n如果您的 GPU 使用率达到最大或者帧率有问题，请降低此设置。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.threadPresetSetting": "CPU负载",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.threadPresetSetting.@tooltip": "修改使用的线程数量。\n\n增加此设置将提高远景生成速度和LOD加载速度，\n但也会增加CPU/内存占用，并可能引起卡顿。\n\n注意：在具有4个核心或更少核心的CPU上，这些设置的效果会较差，\n某些设置可能会产生相似的结果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.optionsButton": "显示设置按钮",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.optionsButton.@tooltip": "显示设置按钮在视场角按钮的左边",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced": "高级设置选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics": "图像",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality": "渲染质量",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution": "最大水平分辨率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution.@tooltip": "LODs的最大渲染细节级别为\n\n§6最快：§r区块\n§6最精细：§r方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius": "LOD渲染半径",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius.@tooltip": "Distant Horizons的渲染距离，以区块为单位。\n\n注意：这是一个尽力而为的数值。实际的渲染距离可能会根据你的其他图形设置而高于或低于此数值。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality": "垂直质量",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality.@tooltip": "LOD对悬垂物、洞穴、悬崖等表现的细节程度。\n\n更高的设置会增加内存和GPU的使用量。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale": "水平比例",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale.@tooltip": "LOD降低质量的速度。\n\n更大的数值将改善远处地形的外观，\n但会增加内存和GPU的占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality": "LOD衰减距离",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality.@tooltip": "不同细节层次间质量下降的距离间隔。\n\n较高的设置会增加质量下降之间距离，\n但这会增加内存和GPU的占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.transparency": "透明度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.blocksToIgnore": "忽略的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.blocksToIgnore.@tooltip": "定义在生成LOD时应忽略的方块类型。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.tintWithAvoidedBlocks": "使用避免的方块进行着色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.tintWithAvoidedBlocks.@tooltip": "§4注意：这使雪、地毯和活板门看起来非常糟糕§r\n在避免方块下方的方块应该获得避免方块的颜色吗？\n§6开：§r 草地上的红花会使其下方的草地变成红色\n§6关：§r 避免的方块不会改变其下表面的颜色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending": "生物群系混合",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending.@tooltip": "这与原版的生物群系混合设置相同，应用于LOD区域。\n\n请注意，除'0'以外的任何设置都将极大地影响LOD构建时间\n并增加三角面数量。如果设置得过高，对方块生成速度的影响也非常大。\n\n'0' 等同于原版的生物群系混合 '1x1',\n'1' 等同于原版的生物群系混合 '3x3',\n'2' 等同于原版的生物群系混合 '5x5'... 以此类推。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog": "雾",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.drawMode": "雾的绘制",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.drawMode.@tooltip": "怎么在LOD上渲染雾",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.distance": "雾的距离",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.distance.@tooltip": "雾将在LOD上渲染的距离。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode": "雾的颜色模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode.@tooltip": "LOD上雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.disableVanillaFog": "禁用原版雾",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.disableVanillaFog.@tooltip": "§6开:§r 禁用原版区块上的雾。\n§6关:§r 原版区块上正常渲染雾效果。\n\n可能会与其他修改雾效果的模组产生冲突。\n如果原版区块完全被雾覆盖，可以禁用此选项。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog": "高级雾设置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogStart": "远处雾的起点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogStart.@tooltip": "远处雾应从何处开始？\n\n  '0.0'：雾起始于玩家当前位置。\n  '1.0'：雾起始的圆圈正好契合LOD渲染距离的正方形范围。\n'1.414'：LOD渲染距离的正方形范围正好位于雾起始圆内。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogEnd": "远处雾的终点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogEnd.@tooltip": "远处雾应在何处结束？\n\n  '0.0'：雾在在玩家当前位置结束。\n  '1.0'：雾结束的圆圈正好适应LOD渲染距离的正方形。\n'1.414'：LOD渲染距离的正方形正好适应雾结束圆的范围。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogMin": "远处雾厚度的最小值",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogMin.@tooltip": "雾的最小厚度应该是多少？\n\n  '0.0'：完全没有雾。\n  '1.0'：完全为雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogMax": "远处雾厚度的最大值",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogMax.@tooltip": "雾的最大厚度应该是多少？\n\n  '0.0'：完全没有雾。\n  '1.0'：完全为雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogFalloff": "远处雾的衰减",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogFalloff.@tooltip": "雾的厚度应如何计算？\n\n线性：基于距离的线性计算（将会忽略“密度”）\n指数：1/e^(距离密度)\n指数平方：1/e^((距离密度)^2)\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogDensity": "远方雾密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.farFogDensity.@tooltip": "雾有多密？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao": "环境光遮蔽",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.enabled": "启用环境光遮蔽",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.enabled.@tooltip": "环境光遮蔽为方块的光照添加深度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.sampleCount": "采样数量",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.sampleCount.@tooltip": "决定在遮挡测试中空间中采样的点数。\n较大的数字将提高质量并减少条带现象，但会增加GPU负载。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.radius": "半径",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.radius.@tooltip": "确定应用屏幕空间环境光遮蔽的半径，以区块为单位。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.strength": "强度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.strength.@tooltip": "决定屏幕空间环境光遮蔽效果的暗度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.bias": "偏置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.bias.@tooltip": "增加该值可以减少条带现象，但会牺牲效果的强度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.minLight": "最小光照",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.minLight.@tooltip": "决定遮挡阴影可以有多暗。\n0 = 角落完全黑色\n1 = 无阴影",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.blurRadius": "模糊半径",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.ssao.blurRadius.@tooltip": "以像素为单位测量的SSAO模糊计算半径。\n较大的数值会减少条带现象，但会牺牲GPU性能。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog": "高度雾设置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode": "高度雾混合模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode.@tooltip": "高度如何影响雾浓度？\n\n基础：无特殊高度雾效果。雾根据摄像机距离计算\n忽略高度：完全忽略高度。雾根据水平距离计算\n相加：高度雾 + 远雾\n最大值：max(高度雾, 远雾)\n相乘：高度雾 * 远雾\n倒数相乘：1 - (1-高度雾) * (1-远雾)\n受限相加：远雾 + max(远雾, 高度雾)\n相乘后相加：远雾 + 远雾 * 高度雾\n倒数相乘后相加：远雾 + 1 - (1-高度雾) * (1-远雾)\n平均值：远雾*0.5 + 高度雾*0.5\n\n注意，'基础'模式和'忽略高度'模式下，高度雾设置无效。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogMode": "高度雾模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogMode.@tooltip": "高度雾应位于何处？\n\n高于摄像机：高度雾从摄像机延伸至天空\n低于摄像机：高度雾从摄像机延伸至虚空\n摄像机上下方：高度雾从摄像机同时延伸至天空和虚空\n设定高度以上：高度雾从设定高度延伸至天空\n设定高度以下：高度雾从设定高度延伸至虚空\n设定高度上下方：高度雾从设定高度同时延伸至天空和虚空\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight": "高度雾基准高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight.@tooltip": "如果高度雾围绕设定高度计算，这个高度是多少？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogStart": "高度雾起始偏移",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogStart.@tooltip": "高度雾起始位置应该偏移多少？\n\n  '0.0': 无偏移。\n  '1.0': 偏移整个世界的高度（包含深度）。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogEnd": "高度雾结束偏移",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogEnd.@tooltip": "高度雾结束位置应该偏移多少？\n\n  '0.0': 无偏移。\n  '1.0': 偏移整个世界的高度（包含深度）。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogMin": "高度雾最小浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogMin.@tooltip": "最小雾浓度是多少？\n\n  '0.0': 完全没有雾。\n  '1.0': 完全为雾的颜色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogMax": "高度雾最大浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogMax.@tooltip": "最大雾浓度是多少？\n\n  '0.0': 完全没有雾。\n  '1.0': 完全为雾的颜色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff": "高度雾衰减方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff.@tooltip": "高度雾浓度计算方式？\n\n线性：基于高度的线性（会忽略“密度”）\n指数：1/(e^(高度*密度))\n指数平方：1/(e^((高度*密度)^2))\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogDensity": "高度雾密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog.heightFog.heightFogDensity.@tooltip": "高度雾有多密？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTextureSettings": "噪点纹理设置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTextureSettings.noiseEnabled": "启用噪点纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTextureSettings.noiseEnabled.@tooltip": "如果启用，将对LOD应用噪点纹理以模拟纹理。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTextureSettings.noiseSteps": "噪点层级",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTextureSettings.noiseSteps.@tooltip": "决定应用于LOD的噪点层级数量。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTextureSettings.noiseIntensity": "噪点强度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTextureSettings.noiseIntensity.@tooltip": "决定噪点纹理的强度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTextureSettings.noiseDropoff": "噪点消减距离",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTextureSettings.noiseDropoff.@tooltip": "定义噪点纹理应在多远之后开始淡出。（以方块计）。\n设置为0可禁用噪点淡出。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics": "高级图像设置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.overdrawPrevention": "过度绘制预防",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.overdrawPrevention.@tooltip": "决定Distant Horizons从相机多远处开始渲染。测量为原版渲染距离的百分比。\n\n较高的值会防止LOD在更远的距离上渲染到原版方块后面，\n但可能导致LOD中出现空洞。当穿越未加载的地形时，空洞最可能出现。\n\n增加原版渲染距离会提高此设置的效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.brightnessMultiplier": "亮度倍增器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.brightnessMultiplier.@tooltip": "控制LOD颜色的亮度。\n\n0 = 黑色\n1 = 正常\n2 = 接近白色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.saturationMultiplier": "饱和度倍增器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.saturationMultiplier.@tooltip": "控制LOD颜色的饱和度。\n\n0 = 黑白\n1 = 正常\n2 = 鲜艳",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.enableCaveCulling": "洞穴剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.enableCaveCulling.@tooltip": "如果启用，洞穴将被剔除。\n\n附加信息：目前这会剔除所有天空亮度值为0，在洞穴剔除高度以下且在没有天花板的维度中的面。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.caveCullingHeight": "洞穴剔除高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.caveCullingHeight.@tooltip": "洞穴剔除应该在哪个Y轴值开始？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.earthCurveRatio": "地球曲率比例 §6(实验性)§r",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.earthCurveRatio.@tooltip": "值为1等同于现实生活中地球的曲率。最小接受值为50，最大值为5000。介于1和49之间的任何值都将四舍五入至50。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.lodBias": "LOD偏置 §6(影响原版地形)§r",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.lodBias.@tooltip": "设置原版的LOD偏置值。请按F3+T重载纹理包以应用此效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.lodShading": "LOD阴影处理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.lodShading.@tooltip": "定义LOD应该如何着色。可用于改善着色器兼容性。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.disableFrustumCulling": "禁用视锥体剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.disableFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "如果为关，玩家相机外的LOD不会被绘制，从而提高GPU性能。\n\n如果为开，则所有LOD都会被绘制，包括那些在玩家相机后面的，这会降低GPU性能。\n\n如果你看到LOD在视野角落消失，请禁用此选项。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling": "禁用阴影传递视锥体剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "与另一个视锥体剔除选项相同，只是它仅在存在使用Distant Horizons API的着色器模组并且正在渲染阴影传递时使用。\n\n如果阴影渲染不正确，请禁用此选项。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.grassSideRendering": "草方块侧面渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.advancedGraphics.grassSideRendering.@tooltip": "草方块LOD的侧面和底部应该如何渲染？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator": "世界生成",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator.enableDistantGeneration.@tooltip": "§6正确:§r 在单人游戏中，LOD将在原版渲染距离之外生成。\n注意：这可能会导致CPU占用非常高。\n\n§6错误:§r LOD仅会在原版渲染距离内生成。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator.distantGeneratorMode": "远距离生成模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator.distantGeneratorMode.@tooltip": "当在原版渲染距离之外生成LOD时，生成的复杂度应该如何设定。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator.worldGenLightingEngine": "光照引擎",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator.worldGenLightingEngine.@tooltip": "§6Minecraft:§r 使用原版的光照引擎，提供准确的光照效果。\n§6Distant Horizons:§r 估算光照，阴影可能不那么平滑，但更稳定。\n\n如果LOD显示为黑色，请将此设置为§6Distant Horizons§r。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator.worldGenerationTimeoutLengthInSeconds": "生成超时长度（秒）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator.worldGenerationTimeoutLengthInSeconds.@tooltip": "世界生成线程在超时前应运行多久？\n注意：如果您遇到超时错误，最好首先通过线程配置降低CPU使用率，\n然后再更改此值。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator.generationPriority": "生成优先级",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator.generationPriority.@tooltip": "围绕玩家生成区块的优先级。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding": "LOD构建",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding.minTimeBetweenChunkUpdatesInSeconds": "区块更新之间的最短时间（秒）",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding.minTimeBetweenChunkUpdatesInSeconds.@tooltip": "确定两次LOD区块更新之间必须经过的时间长度，之后才能进行下一次更新。\n增加此值会降低CPU负载，但可能导致LOD更快过时或长时间保持过时。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding.onlyUseDhLightingEngine": "仅使用Distant Horizons光照引擎",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding.onlyUseDhLightingEngine.@tooltip": "如果为关，LOD将在可能的情况下由Minecraft的光照引擎照亮，并且仅在必要时才回退到Distant Horizons光照引擎。\n如果为开，LOD将仅使用Distant Horizons的光照引擎进行照明。\n通常最好保持此选项关闭，仅在存在光照问题或调试时才开启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding.dataCompression": "数据压缩算法",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding.dataCompression.@tooltip": "应使用哪种算法来压缩新的LOD数据？\n此设置仅影响新生成或更新的LOD数据，\n在更改此设置时已经生成的任何数据在需要重新写入数据库之前都将不受影响。\n\n最快：LZ4\n最高压缩比：LZMA2",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding.worldCompression": "有损世界数据压缩",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding.worldCompression.@tooltip": "在创建LOD数据时，应如何压缩区块数据？\n此设置仅影响新生成或更新的LOD数据，\n在更改此设置时已经生成的任何数据在被修改或重新加载前都将保持不变。\n\n最准确：合并相同方块\n最高压缩比： 视觉上相同",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding.showMigrationChatWarning": "在聊天中记录迁移信息",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer": "多人游戏",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode": "服务器文件夹模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode.@tooltip": "决定本地多人游戏数据的文件夹格式。\n\n§6仅名称:§r\n使用服务器名称。例如：\"Minecraft 服务器\"\n§6名称和IP:§r\n\"Minecraft 服务器, IP 192.168.1.40\"\n§6名称、IP和端口:§r\n\"Minecraft 服务器, IP 192.168.1.40:25565\"\n§6名称、IP 、端和游戏版本:§r\n\"Minecraft 服务器, IP 192.168.1.40:25565, MC Version: 1.18.1\"\n\n§c§l警告:§r 连接到多人服务器时更改此设置可能导致故障。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.multiverseSimilarityRequiredPercent": "多维度要求相似度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.multiverseSimilarityRequiredPercent.@tooltip": "当匹配相同维度类型的世界时，\n被测试的区块必须至少有这个百分比的相似度\n才能被视为同一个世界。\n\n注意：如果你使用传送门从两个不同的位置进入一个维度，\n该系统可能会认为这是两个不同的世界。\n\n§61.0:§r 区块必须完全相同。\n§60.5:§r 区块必须有一半相同。\n§60.0:§r 禁用多维度支持\n      每个维度只使用一个世界。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.enableMultiverseNetworking": "网络多维度支持",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.enableMultiverseNetworking.@tooltip": "如果为开，Distant Horizons 将尝试与连接的\n服务器通信以增强多维度支持。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.enableServerNetworking": "§4未实现，仅供开发者使用§r - 服务器支持",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.enableServerNetworking.@tooltip": "§6注意：§r 此功能仅为开发者设计且尚未实现。\n\n如果为真，Distant Horizons 将尝试与连接的\n服务器通信以便加载超出原生渲染距离之外的LOD。\n\n注意：这需要服务器上安装Distant Horizons才能正常工作。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading": "多线程",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.numberOfWorldGenerationThreads": "世界生成线程数",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.numberOfWorldGenerationThreads.@tooltip": "在生成超出常规渲染距离之外的LOD时应使用多少个线程？\n\n如果你在生成远处LOD时遇到卡顿，请减少此数值。如果你希望加快LOD生成速度，请增加此数值。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.runTimeRatioForWorldGenerationThreads": "世界生成线程运行时间百分比",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.numberOfBufferBuilderThreads": "缓冲区构建线程数",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.numberOfBufferBuilderThreads.@tooltip": "构建几何数据时使用的线程数量。\n只能在1和您CPU处理器数量之间取值。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.runTimeRatioForBufferBuilderThreads": "缓冲区构建线程运行时间百分比",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.numberOfFileHandlerThreads": "文件处理器线程数",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.numberOfFileHandlerThreads.@tooltip": "读取/写入磁盘上的LOD数据时使用的线程数量。\n也只能在1和您CPU处理器数量之间取值。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.runTimeRatioForFileHandlerThreads": "文件处理器线程运行时间百分比",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.numberOfUpdatePropagatorThreads": "更新传播线程数",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.numberOfUpdatePropagatorThreads.@tooltip": "应用LOD更新时应使用多少个线程？\nLOD更新是指将高细节层次的LOD降采样为较低细节层次的操作。\n\n此配置可以分配更多的线程数，并且与其他线程池相比具有更低的运行时间比例，\n因为任何特定线程可能运行的时间相对较短。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.runTimeRatioForUpdatePropagatorThreads": "更新传播线程运行时间百分比",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.numberOfLodBuilderThreads": "LOD构建线程数",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.numberOfLodBuilderThreads.@tooltip": "构建LOD时使用的线程数量。\n这些线程在地形生成时运行，当特定图形设置更改时，以及在世界中移动时运行。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading.runTimeRatioForLodBuilderThreads": "LOD构建线程运行时间百分比",
